messages.content:
I'll extend the message images to a large, editable presentation and give them the same click‑to‑edit behaviour as the attachment list, by adding a self‑contained image editor modal used by `ChatEntry`.

**Changes summary**

| File | Change |
|---|---|
| `client/src/components/chat/ChatImageEditorModal.vue` | **New.** Large image viewer + editor (zoom, rotate, crop, resize, alt text, download, apply). |
| `client/src/components/ChatEntry.vue` | Media block renders images big and full column width, above the message text; click opens the editor; saved edits are written back to `message.images` and persisted. |

